 form='<section class="business-form" data-business-form="'+kind+'" aria-labelledby="worksheet-title"><h2 id="worksheet-title">Use the editable '+c['name'].lower()+'</h2><p class="form-help">Start blank or load the labelled fictional example. Entries stay in this page unless you save or export them. Device storage belongs to this browser; keep a JSON backup for another device. Scroll the item table horizontally on a small screen.</p><noscript><p>This worksheet needs JavaScript. The Excel and printable PDF downloads above work without it.</p></noscript><div class="form-actions"><button type="button" data-action="sample">Load fictional example</button><button type="button" data-action="blank">Start blank</button></div><div class="form-meta">'
