 form+='</div><div data-result aria-live="polite"></div><p class="form-result-note">Typed review status is a manual record. It does not verify identity, approve spending, send an order or move money.</p><div class="form-actions"><button type="button" data-action="save">Save on this device</button><button type="button" data-action="restore">Restore device copy</button><button type="button" data-action="backup">Download JSON backup</button><label class="backup-label">Restore JSON backup<input type="file" accept=".json,application/json" data-import></label><button type="button" data-action="csv">Export CSV report</button><button type="button" data-action="print">Print / Save PDF</button></div><p data-status role="status"></p></section>'
 body='<main class="business-resource" style="--form-accent:'+c['color']+'"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/tools/">Free Planners</a> / '+esc(c['name'])+'</nav><p class="resource-kicker">FREE RESOURCE · EXCEL + PDF + BROWSER WORKSHEET</p><h1>'+esc(c['title'])+'</h1><p>'+esc(c['lead'])+'</p><p class="resource-downloads"><a href="/assets/downloads/'+slug+'.xlsx" download>Download Excel (.xlsx)</a><a href="/assets/downloads/'+slug+'.pdf" download>Download printable PDF</a><a href="#worksheet-title">Use editable worksheet</a></p><p>Published October 24, 2026 · By NexalyPlanner Editorial · No signup required</p><figure class="resource-cover"><a href="/assets/img/resource-previews/'+slug+'-worksheet.webp"><img src="/assets/img/resource-previews/'+slug+'-cover.webp" width="1200" height="800" alt="'+esc('Actual '+c['name'].lower()+' workbook excerpt with fictional example amounts')+'" fetchpriority="high"></a><figcaption>Actual workbook excerpt, using fictional data. <a href="/assets/img/resource-previews/'+slug+'-worksheet.webp">View the full example worksheet</a>.</figcaption></figure><h2>What is included?</h2><ul><li><strong>Excel:</strong> Blank, Filled example and Instructions tabs; ten item rows with editable inputs and calculated amounts.</li><li><strong>Printable PDF:</strong> two US Letter landscape pages, one blank and one filled fictional example. It is a static form for handwriting, not an interactive PDF.</li><li><strong>Browser worksheet:</strong> ten editable rows, local save/restore, JSON backup, CSV report and browser print.</li></ul><p>The .xlsx has no macros. There is no native Google Sheets copy or Word file. Browser JSON backups restore into this browser worksheet, not the workbook or a paid app. CSV preserves a report, not an editable backup with formulas.</p>'+form+'<h2>How to use the '+esc(c['name'].lower())+'</h2><ol>'+''.join('<li><strong>'+esc(h)+'.</strong> '+esc(t)+'</li>' for h,t in c['steps'])+'</ol><h2>Worked example: check the result</h2><p>'+esc(c['example'])+'</p><p>Load the fictional example above to inspect the calculation. The Excel Filled example tab and the second PDF page use the same inputs. A blank form stays incomplete until the required rows and adjustment amounts are supplied. Enter 0 for a charge that does not apply.</p>'+''.join('<h2>'+esc(h)+'</h2><p>'+esc(t)+'</p>' for h,t in c['unique'])+'<h2>Save, reopen and print</h2><p>In the browser, choose Save on this device deliberately; entries are not saved automatically. Restore device copy retrieves that browser’s last saved version. Clearing browser storage or using a private window can remove it. Download JSON backup before switching devices or closing an important session, and store files containing customer or employee details appropriately.</p><p>For Excel, save a separate .xlsx per '+('claim' if kind=='expense' else 'request' if kind=='requisition' else 'order')+'. Reopen it and change one value to check recalculation before using it operationally. Select A1:H33 on the required tab, use landscape Print Selection and fit to one page. Column J contains row review messages outside that print area; fix them first. Ten rows are provided: do not extend the form without checking formulas and total ranges.</p><p>The downloadable PDF has a fixed layout. Browser Print / Save PDF uses your browser’s print dialog and may span more than one page; check every row and field in preview. The workbook has been recalculated and export/import tested with Artifact Tool. Native Excel, Google Sheets, physical printer output and real-phone behavior have not been certified.</p><h2>Related workflow</h2><ul>'+''.join('<li>Continue with the <a href="'+path+'">'+esc(label)+'</a>.</li>' for path,label in c['links'])+'</ul><p>For a broader optional workflow, read about the <a href="'+c['product']+'">'+esc(c['productName'])+'</a>. This free form works independently; its backup files do not import into the paid product.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>'+''.join('<h3>'+esc(q)+'</h3><p>'+esc(a)+'</p>' for q,a in c['faq'])
